    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nDNG Ella Dunphy are delighted to present to the market this charming three-bedroom detached bungalow at Cloneen, Castlecomer, Co. Kilkenny, R95 KH6K. Set on a beautifully maintained site in a peaceful countryside setting, this attractive home offers the convenience of single-storey living together with generous outdoor space. Presented in excellent turn-key condition, the property has been lovingly cared for and is ready for immediate occupation. With its mature garden, spacious accommodation and tranquil surroundings, it presents an ideal opportunity for families, downsizers or those seeking a peaceful country lifestyle while remaining within easy reach of local amenities.\n\nThe bungalow offers bright and inviting accommodation comprising of three well-proportioned bedrooms and comfortable living areas, with a practical layout that caters well to modern family living. The property has been maintained to a high standard throughout, allowing the new owners to move in and enjoy the home from day one.\n\nOne of the property's standout features is the extensive rear garden, which has been beautifully maintained and provides a wonderful sense of privacy and space. The mature garden offers an ideal setting for gardening enthusiasts, outdoor entertaining, family activities or simply relaxing in the peaceful surroundings. A patio area provides an excellent space for outdoor dining and entertaining, while the generous grounds are sure to appeal to those who value outdoor space. To the front, the extensive paved forecourt provides ample off-street parking and adds to the property's practicality.\n\nAdding a further dimension to the property is a Shomera-style garden studio, which provides an excellent additional space separate from the main house. Fully insulated and fitted with full electrics, this versatile studio is currently ideally suited as a home office and offers a comfortable and practical environment for those working from home. The space could equally lend itself to a range of uses including a creative studio, hobby room, gym or additional recreational space, depending on the needs of the new owner.\n\nThe location offers the best of both worlds, combining the tranquillity of countryside living with convenient access to Castlecomer and its range of amenities. The town is within easy reach and provides a selection of shops, supermarkets, cafés, schools, sporting facilities and healthcare services, while Castlecomer Discovery Park provides a popular recreational amenity for all ages. Kilkenny City is approximately 25 minutes by car, offering an extensive range of shopping, dining, educational, cultural and recreational amenities. The property also provides convenient access to the wider road network, with the M7/M8 motorway network approximately 20 minutes away, facilitating travel towards Dublin, the Midlands and beyond.\n\nOverall, this is a wonderful opportunity to acquire a well-maintained three-bedroom bungalow in a peaceful and attractive countryside setting. With its generous gardens, ample parking, excellent outdoor space and convenient location, this property is sure to appeal to a wide range of purchasers.\n\nEntrance Hall Bright and spacious T-shaped entrance hall featuring warm wooden flooring and an open layout, creating a welcoming first impression of the home.\n\nKitchen A spacious and well-appointed open-plan kitchen featuring warm wooden flooring, ample over- and under-counter storage, integrated appliances, a tastefully tiled splashback and a large window providing plenty of natural light, with plenty of space for family dining and entertaining.\n\nDining/Living Area A spacious and versatile dual-purpose dining and living area featuring warm wooden flooring and a striking feature fireplace with a wood-burning stove, creating an attractive focal point. Large windows provide plenty of natural light, while patio doors offer direct access to the outside, making this an ideal space for everyday living, dining and entertaining.\n\nSitting Room A bright and generously proportioned reception room featuring warm wooden flooring and a large window that floods the space with natural light, perfect for relaxing or entertaining.\n\nMaster Bedroom A well-proportioned double bedroom featuring extensive built-in wardrobe space providing ample storage, wooden flooring and a large window allowing plenty of natural light.\n\nBedroom A generously sized double bedroom with wooden flooring and built-in wardrobes, offering a comfortable and practical space with ample storage.\n\nBedroom A well-proportioned double bedroom featuring warm wooden flooring and a large window that floods the space with natural light, offering a versatile room suitable as a guest bedroom, child's bedroom or nursery.\n\nWalk-In Wardrobe A well-appointed walk-in wardrobe featuring extensive built-in storage, providing ample storage options.\n\nMain Bathroom Beautifully finished family bathroom featuring floor-to-ceiling tiling, contemporary sanitary ware, a full-size bath with shower and a clean, modern finish.\n\n*Disclaimer - photos have been edited using AI to enhance or brighten the image*"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> Presented in excellent turnkey condition.</li><li> Located in a quiet cul-de-sac, offering a peaceful and private setting.</li><li> Fully equipped Shomera-style garden studio/home office, fully insulated and wired with electricity, providing an excellent additional space</li><li> Substantial mature site wrapping around the property, offering excellent privacy, space and beautifully maintained gardens with a patio area. Viewing is essential to appreciate the scale and privacy of the grounds.</li><li> Local primary school within walking distance, making the property particularly appealing to families.</li><li> Close to local schools, shops, and everyday amenities - 5 minutes' drive to Castlecomer.</li><li> Excellent connectivity 20-minute drive to M8 & M9 motorway and 25-minute drive to Kilkenny City.</li><li> Ideal family home or downsizer property.</ul>"
      },
